5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose during the move and every morning after.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Before we move desks, I need to understand the actual monthly cost of this floor.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should decide who takes the noisiest spots before we start moving anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am interested in how the current layout affects my physical comfort over a full day.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to see how the new plan compares to what everyone actually wanted in the survey.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, does the billing include the time we are sitting on the floor?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, it includes the space, but I need to see the breakdown of the line items.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if you are uncomfortable, that is a valid reason to claim a specific spot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, comfort is not a preference, it is a requirement for sustained focus.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Rin, I hope the survey data shows we all want to be closer to the window.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I am worried about the gaps between meetings disappearing if the layout is bad.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the billing basis and the facilities quote for power.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the check.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look into the physio's note and the sound meter readings across the room.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will investigate the arrival times in the badge records and the unplanned seat shuffles.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let us see the numbers before we commit to a shape.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will also look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will confirm my choices: physio's note and sound meter readings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will confirm my choices: drawn plan against the staff survey and arrival times.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
