60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A is a disaster for my gaps. If I arrive at 9:30, the good desks are already taken.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A means we re-run power for every single person every single day. The 6,200 yen charge would bankrupt us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option A is the only one that forces us to confront who is actually using the space. It is honest, if chaotic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A is unacceptable. My body needs a fixed point. I will not be moving my chair every day.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option A feels like a game. I want to know who I am sitting beside before I walk in the door.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Option B is better, but if the rotation is monthly, I still lose my morning routine every month.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Option B is the only one that does not trigger the 6,200 yen charge every time someone moves. It is the only financially sane choice.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Option B is a compromise. It gives everyone a turn at the window, but it also means everyone has to sit in the noisy row at some point.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"Option B is a slow death. I will spend a month in the noisy row, and my body will never settle.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"Option B is fair, but it means I might be stuck next to someone I do not talk to for a whole month.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Option C is the only one that protects my gaps. If my desk is mine, I can plan my morning around it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"Option C is the most expensive. Every time we change a function, we pay 6,200 yen. But it is the most stable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Option C is the only one that lets us say out loud who is in the noisy row. It is transparent, which is what I want.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Option C is the only one that respects my body. If my desk is fixed, my setup stays fixed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,Option C is the only one that lets us decide who sits beside whom. It is the only one that is actually about us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,I am voting for Option C. It is the only one that protects my time and my gaps.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I am voting for Option B. It is the only one that does not bankrupt us with re-running charges.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am voting for Option C. It is the only one that makes the noise assignment explicit and fair.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,I am voting for Option C. It is the only one that keeps my body in a state of settled comfort.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"I am voting for Option C. It is the only one that lets us choose who we sit beside, not the furniture.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
